* text=auto eol=lf
*.rs diff=rust
*.md diff=markdown
# Parallel branches only append to these two: a union merge keeps both sides'
# lines instead of a conflict. Never for files whose lines are edited in place
# (phase-N.md checklists, open-questions.md, crate cards): union would keep the
# old and the new line (docs/agents/workflow.md#merging-parallel-branches).
docs/adr/README.md merge=union
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
